      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriphofika mwaka wa sabaa Jehoyada wadzipha moyo, achiahala akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi gana-gana, Azaria mwana wa Jerohamu, Isimaili mwana wa Jehohanani, Azaria mwana wa Obedi, Maaseya mwana wa Adaya na Elishafati mwana wa Zikiri, achiika chilagane nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinya atu atsano azunguluka tsi ya Juda achikusanya Alawi kula midzi yosi ya Juda na akulu a mbari za Iziraeli, achedza nao Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hinyo mkpwutano uchihenda chilagane na Joashi, mwana wa mfalume ndani ya Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. Naye Jehoyada achiaambira, “Lolani mwana wa mfalume hiyu! Mricheni atawale dza arivyogomba Mwenyezi Mlungu kuhusiana na nyumba ya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnalondwa muhende hivi; mwimwi alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi, munaphoinjira zuma Siku ya Kuoya, dziganyeni madiba mahahu. Diba mwenga naririnde pho ryangoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diba ranjina rindarinda nyumba ya mfalume na diba ranjina rindarinda ryango riihwaro ryango ra msingi na hinyo anjina osi andakala kpwenye muhala wa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msiruhusu mutu yeyesi kuinjira Nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu isiphokala alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi ambao a kpwenye zuma. Hinyo andainjira kpwa mana ni atakatifu, ela atu anjina ni asikize yo amuri ya Mwenyezi Mlungu ya kusainjira mumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwimwi Alawi mzungulukeni mfalume, chila mmwenga na silahaye mkpwononi. Mutu yeyesi ndiyemenya himo nyumbani naolagbwe. Kalani na mfalume, kokosi ndikophiya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alawi osi na atu osi a Juda ahenda dza arivyoamriwa ni mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada. Chila chilongozi wareha kundire, hara ariokala akamala zuma na hara ariokala anainjira kugbwira zuma kahi ya Siku ya kuoya, osi akalapho. Mana mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada kayagaruhusu go madiba gauke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ye mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada achiapha nyo akulu a anajeshi a gana-gana mafumo na ngao kulu na ndide. Mafumo gaga na ngao zizi kala ni za mfalume Daudi, nazo kala zi mo ndani ya nyumba ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiapanga nyo atu, chila mmwenga na silahaye mkpwononi, kuzunguluka ye mfalume, phephi na pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka na yo nyumba ya Mlungu kula uphande wa mwakani hadi uphande wa vurini wa yo nyumba ya Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mwana wa mfalume achituluzwa kondze, achimvwika tadzi na achimupha nakala ya chilagane nao achimtangaza kukala mfalume. Jehoyada na anae achimmwagira mafuha nao achipiga kululu achiamba, “Mfalume, kala na maisha mare!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athalia ariphosikira kululu za atu anazola kuno anatogola mfalume, waphiya hadi ko nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aripholola, waona mfalume aimire phephi na nguzo, dza irivyokala kawaida, nao akulu a jeshi na apigi a magunda kala aimire phephi na mfalume, na enyezi osi a yo tsi kala anapiga njerejere na kupiga magunda, na aimbadzi achilongoza sharee kpwa kupiga vifwaya vyao vya mawira. Phahi, Athalia wakpwanyula nguwoze na achipiga kululu achiamba, “Mapinduzi! Mapinduzi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada achiatuluza kondze nyo akulu majeshi a gana-gana, ariokala anaimirira go majeshi achiambira, “Mtuluzeni kondze kahi-kahi ya asikari na mutu yeyesi ndiyemlunga muolageni na upanga.” Kpwa kukala mlavyadzi-sadaka kala akaamba, “Msimuolage ndani ya Nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amgbwira achiphiya naye hadi ryango ambaro kala richihumirwa kuinjizira farasi nyumba ya mfalume, achimuolagira phapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jehoyada wahenda chilagane kahi ya iye mwenye, atu osi na ye mfalume kukala andakala atu a Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha atu osi aphiya kpwenye nyumba ya Baali achendaibomola, avundza phatu pha kulavira sadaka phamwenga na vizukavye, hata achimuolaga Matani, mlavyadzi-sadaka wa Baali mbere za phatu pha kulavira sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoyada walagiza phakale na uimirizi wa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu tsini ya ulongozi wa alavyadzi-sadaka ambao kala ni Alawi dza irivyopangbwa ni Daudi. Atu areha sadaka za kuochwa himo ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu dza irivyoandikpwa kpwenye shariya ya Musa, kuno akahererwa na kuimba sawa-sawa na vira Daudi arivyolagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoyada waika arindzi maryangoni mwa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu ili mutu yeyesi ariye najisi chivyovyosi asimenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
